  <data name="MigrationNotice.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Preview the chosen folder and its subfolders. Only JPEG and PNG support this lossless migration; other formats, ambiguous associations, and conflicting properties are skipped. Neither embedded nor sidecar values win a conflict. Complete XMP properties, including unknown namespaces, are retained. Pixel data, orientation, and all non-XMP bytes stay unchanged. Original media and sidecars are backed up beside the photos in .photolibrarian-migration-backups. A sidecar is removed only after verified on-disk read-back. Cancel stops between files; a file already committing finishes safely.</value></data>
